### 1 — ADMIN создаёт тестового пользователя (201)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "forced-change-test@example.com",
  "password": "OriginalPassword123!",
  "role": "USER"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("resetUserId", response.body.id);
%}


### 2 — Вход до сброса (200, passwordChangeRequired=false)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "forced-change-test@example.com",
  "password": "OriginalPassword123!"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("oldUserToken", response.body.accessToken);
%}


### 3 — Старый токен работает в Booking (200)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/my
Authorization: Bearer {{oldUserToken}}


### 4 — Старый токен работает в Hotel (200)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/hotels
Authorization: Bearer {{oldUserToken}}

### 9 — Вход с временным паролем (200, passwordChangeRequired=true)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "forced-change-test@example.com",
  "password": "TemporaryPassword123!"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("temporaryToken", response.body.accessToken);
%}


### 10 — Обычный API Booking запрещён (403)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/my
Authorization: Bearer {{temporaryToken}}


### 11 — Hotel API запрещён (403)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/hotels
Authorization: Bearer {{temporaryToken}}


### 12 — Неправильный временный пароль (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/me/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{temporaryToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "WrongPassword123!",
  "newPassword": "NewPermanentPassword123!"
}


### 13 — Слишком короткий новый пароль (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/me/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{temporaryToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "TemporaryPassword123!",
  "newPassword": "123"
}

### 14 — Пользователь меняет временный пароль (200)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/me/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{temporaryToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "TemporaryPassword123!",
  "newPassword": "NewPermanentPassword123!"
}


### 15 — Временный JWT отозван после смены (401)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/my
Authorization: Bearer {{temporaryToken}}


### 16 — Временный JWT в Hotel тоже отозван (401)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/hotels
Authorization: Bearer {{temporaryToken}}


### 17 — Повторный вход с временным паролем запрещён (401)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "forced-change-test@example.com",
  "password": "TemporaryPassword123!"
}


### 18 — Вход с новым паролем (200, passwordChangeRequired=false)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "forced-change-test@example.com",
  "password": "NewPermanentPassword123!"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("newUserToken", response.body.accessToken);
%}


### 19 — Booking снова доступен (200)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/my
Authorization: Bearer {{newUserToken}}


### 20 — Hotel снова доступен (200)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/hotels
Authorization: Bearer {{newUserToken}}


### 21 — Смена пароля без JWT (401)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/me/change-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "NewPermanentPassword123!",
  "newPassword": "AnotherPassword123!"
}


### 22 — USER не может сбрасывать пароль через ADMIN API (403)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/{{resetUserId}}/reset-password
Authorization: Bearer {{newUserToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newPassword": "ForbiddenPassword123!"
}


### 23 — Проверка действующего JWT в Booking (204)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/token-status
Authorization: Bearer {{newUserToken}}